KARNIX BRAIN TUMOUR CNN
Classes: glioma | meningioma | no tumor | pituitary
Training images: 800
Epochs: 1 | Learning rate: 0.0005 | Batch size: 16
Shared pipeline: grayscale -> 64x64 -> Conv/ReLU/Pool x3 -> Dense -> Softmax
Disease model: four-class brain tumour head

PIPELINE
  [1] DATASET       validated manifest: data/brain_tumor/manifest.csv
  [2] PREPROCESSING native C++ image decode -> grayscale -> 64x64
  [3] BATCH LOADER  deterministic shuffle, 50 batches/epoch
  [4] MODEL         Conv/ReLU/Pool x3 -> Dense -> Softmax(4)
  [5] LOSS          multiclass cross-entropy
  [6] BACKPROP      analytical gradients through all layers
  [7] OPTIMIZER     online SGD per loaded sample
  [8] CHECKPOINT    atomic save after every epoch

